    {
      "name": "Trace",
      "definition_uri": "https://w3id.org/fof-ct/Trace",
      "description": "A single chromatin Trace representing global properties associated with an entire polymeric trace rather than with individual Spots. Each instance of this class corresponds to one row in the CSV data section of the FOF-CT Trace Data table. The trace_id links each Trace to the core table and to the RNA Spot Data table. IMPORTANT: this class MUST contain at least one user-defined optional column describing trace-level properties (e.g., Allele, RNA_Expression, Lamina_Distance). User-defined columns are accommodated via open schema.",
